1
00:00:09,140 --> 00:00:10,900
(Supported by NRTA's Online Audiovisual
Quality Creation & Distribution Project)

2
00:00:24,530 --> 00:00:29,150
♪Black hair twines around bone♪

3
00:00:29,620 --> 00:00:33,210
♪Night dew cold♪

4
00:00:35,300 --> 00:00:40,080
♪Bronze mirror cracks
through three lifetimes♪

5
00:00:40,460 --> 00:00:43,390
♪Shines on the sleepless♪

6
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:48,190
♪Yunmeng Marsh ebbs and flows♪

7
00:00:49,040 --> 00:00:51,860
♪Vows sink deep♪

8
00:00:52,810 --> 00:00:57,910
♪White-hair curse turns to snow♪

9
00:00:58,220 --> 00:01:02,710
♪Covering the realm♪

10
00:01:07,620 --> 00:01:10,980
=Reunion Across Time=

11
00:01:11,100 --> 00:01:14,020
=Episode 4=

12
00:01:33,540 --> 00:01:34,900
(Shiqi)

13
00:01:35,870 --> 00:01:36,640
What is it?

14
00:01:37,790 --> 00:01:39,510
This... this...

15
00:01:40,280 --> 00:01:41,040
I...

16
00:01:41,870 --> 00:01:42,640
He...

17
00:01:44,350 --> 00:01:47,000
Why are you up so early?

18
00:01:47,920 --> 00:01:48,760
Master?

19
00:01:53,760 --> 00:01:54,400
It's not...

20
00:01:54,870 --> 00:01:55,680
We...

21
00:01:58,000 --> 00:01:58,560
You...

22
00:01:59,040 --> 00:02:00,230
You can't spread this around.

23
00:02:00,480 --> 00:02:02,000
If this gets out, how can I face anyone?

24
00:02:02,950 --> 00:02:03,590
Don't worry.

25
00:02:03,760 --> 00:02:05,640
I will take responsibility for this.

26
00:02:06,710 --> 00:02:08,310
What happened here isn't what you think.

27
00:02:08,430 --> 00:02:09,520
You mustn't spread it around.

28
00:02:10,430 --> 00:02:11,150
Yes, yes.

29
00:02:11,470 --> 00:02:12,190
Yes, miss.

30
00:02:12,840 --> 00:02:13,310
Right.

31
00:02:13,680 --> 00:02:14,430
That's what I mean.

32
00:02:15,030 --> 00:02:15,960
You can't spread it around.

33
00:02:16,310 --> 00:02:16,840
Understood, Master.

34
00:02:16,910 --> 00:02:17,630
Got it, got it.

35
00:02:18,190 --> 00:02:19,240
You knocked so early in the morning.

36
00:02:19,520 --> 00:02:20,310
What is it?

37
00:02:22,240 --> 00:02:23,360
The King has sent a decree.

38
00:02:23,800 --> 00:02:24,710
Please have a look.

39
00:02:36,120 --> 00:02:36,750
Master,

40
00:02:37,870 --> 00:02:38,910
how should we reply?

41
00:02:39,750 --> 00:02:40,400
I...

42
00:02:41,710 --> 00:02:43,800
Diviner Song will reply
after reading it.

43
00:02:44,750 --> 00:02:45,310
Right.

44
00:02:47,560 --> 00:02:48,280
You may leave.

45
00:02:48,840 --> 00:02:49,470
Yes.

46
00:02:55,680 --> 00:02:56,750
Who told you to open the door?

47
00:02:57,080 --> 00:02:57,910
What do I do now?

48
00:02:58,430 --> 00:02:59,080
Sorry.

49
00:02:59,590 --> 00:03:01,150
I'm still not used to this body.

50
00:03:02,680 --> 00:03:03,360
Don't worry.

51
00:03:03,630 --> 00:03:04,910
Shiqi won't tell anyone.

52
00:03:06,710 --> 00:03:07,870
Hurry and think of a way.

53
00:03:07,960 --> 00:03:09,150
Help me become Grand Shaman

54
00:03:09,710 --> 00:03:10,710
and get the Myriad Souls Lamp.

55
00:03:11,470 --> 00:03:13,360
You can't keep making me
handle official business for you.

56
00:03:13,520 --> 00:03:14,280
I don't know how.

57
00:03:21,800 --> 00:03:24,360
I only told you to drive Chu Li out
of Jinan City.

58
00:03:24,870 --> 00:03:27,400
When did I tell you to take matters
into your own hands and kill her?

59
00:03:31,590 --> 00:03:32,400
Understood.

60
00:03:49,500 --> 00:03:53,100
(42 Days Before the City Falls)

61
00:03:56,120 --> 00:03:57,590
I'm so bored.

62
00:03:57,800 --> 00:03:59,360
Can't you let me go out for a walk?

63
00:03:59,520 --> 00:04:00,240
No.

64
00:04:00,590 --> 00:04:01,710
At this hour every day,

65
00:04:02,030 --> 00:04:03,960
I sit here and handle official business.

66
00:04:07,630 --> 00:04:09,280
I really brought this on myself.

67
00:04:10,190 --> 00:04:11,280
I shouldn't have saved you.

68
00:04:13,030 --> 00:04:15,120
This afternoon you need to
inspect the sacrificial vessels.

69
00:04:15,520 --> 00:04:16,950
Then you can go out.

70
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:20,680
Really?

71
00:04:22,270 --> 00:04:22,920
But

72
00:04:23,160 --> 00:04:24,560
I'll go with you

73
00:04:24,920 --> 00:04:26,040
to avoid suspicion.

74
00:04:27,240 --> 00:04:28,070
Of course.

75
00:04:29,270 --> 00:04:31,270
It's just that this outfit

76
00:04:31,430 --> 00:04:32,560
isn't exactly practical.

77
00:04:33,190 --> 00:04:33,870
How about

78
00:04:34,160 --> 00:04:36,190
I change into men's clothes
and go with you?

79
00:04:36,630 --> 00:04:37,240
Sure.

80
00:04:41,160 --> 00:04:41,720
No.

81
00:04:43,190 --> 00:04:44,360
You can't change clothes.

82
00:04:44,750 --> 00:04:45,920
You're not allowed to see my body.

83
00:04:47,600 --> 00:04:48,630
I can't possibly

84
00:04:49,310 --> 00:04:50,560
never change clothes, can I?

85
00:04:51,240 --> 00:04:52,310
Anyway, you can't change clothes.

86
00:04:52,720 --> 00:04:53,870
If you look at my body,

87
00:04:54,070 --> 00:04:54,920
then I'll look at...

88
00:04:56,830 --> 00:04:57,750
Yours too.

89
00:05:01,240 --> 00:05:02,070
Suit yourself, miss.

90
00:05:02,680 --> 00:05:03,270
You...

91
00:05:06,950 --> 00:05:07,560
Fine.

92
00:05:08,270 --> 00:05:09,000
Wait a moment.

93
00:05:18,240 --> 00:05:18,870
Uncle Maple.

94
00:05:19,950 --> 00:05:20,630
Uncle Maple.

95
00:05:22,390 --> 00:05:23,040
Uncle Maple.

96
00:05:23,920 --> 00:05:24,720
Uncle Maple!

97
00:05:26,190 --> 00:05:27,870
You don't even recognize me now?

98
00:05:32,160 --> 00:05:33,040
Uncle Maple...

99
00:05:33,190 --> 00:05:34,000
(You brat.)

100
00:05:34,120 --> 00:05:35,600
(Stop tormenting these old bones
of mine.)

101
00:05:35,650 --> 00:05:36,310
Uncle Maple,

102
00:05:36,680 --> 00:05:37,950
I was forced into a soul swap

103
00:05:38,040 --> 00:05:39,190
and ended up in this body.

104
00:05:39,830 --> 00:05:41,270
Can you think of a way

105
00:05:41,480 --> 00:05:43,510
for us to switch back two hours a day?

106
00:05:44,480 --> 00:05:45,800
Please, Uncle Maple?

107
00:05:46,270 --> 00:05:46,950
Master.

108
00:05:49,560 --> 00:05:50,190
Master,

109
00:05:50,430 --> 00:05:51,950
are you talking to a tree?

110
00:05:52,510 --> 00:05:53,560
So jumpy.

111
00:05:54,270 --> 00:05:54,950
No, I'm not.

112
00:05:55,600 --> 00:05:56,560
You must've misheard.

113
00:05:58,870 --> 00:05:59,480
Master,

114
00:06:00,560 --> 00:06:01,750
the King has sent a decree.

115
00:06:02,120 --> 00:06:03,430
Your leave has been approved.

116
00:06:03,680 --> 00:06:05,160
You can rest well at home.

117
00:06:07,360 --> 00:06:08,040
Master,

118
00:06:08,800 --> 00:06:10,390
are you feeling unwell?

119
00:06:10,720 --> 00:06:12,830
Shall I fetch a shaman healer
to examine you?

120
00:06:13,600 --> 00:06:14,480
I'm not unwell.

121
00:06:14,830 --> 00:06:15,920
Go, go. Get back to work.

122
00:06:16,870 --> 00:06:17,310
Yes.

123
00:06:17,390 --> 00:06:18,160
Go, hurry.

124
00:06:28,480 --> 00:06:29,830
(You brat.)

125
00:06:30,160 --> 00:06:31,040
(Do you know how many years)

126
00:06:31,090 --> 00:06:32,360
(of cultivation this will cost me?)

127
00:06:32,430 --> 00:06:33,480
Uncle Maple,

128
00:06:34,120 --> 00:06:34,920
help me.

129
00:06:35,160 --> 00:06:36,920
Talk to your brothers and sisters.

130
00:06:37,310 --> 00:06:39,270
Just two hours a day is enough.

131
00:06:40,160 --> 00:06:40,680
Uncle Maple.

132
00:06:40,920 --> 00:06:42,630
Please, Uncle Maple.

133
00:06:43,270 --> 00:06:44,600
- (Last time, to save him,)
- Uncle Maple.

134
00:06:44,720 --> 00:06:46,120
(I lost two hundred leaves.)

135
00:06:46,390 --> 00:06:48,070
(They just grew back
and you're at it again.)

136
00:06:48,310 --> 00:06:49,160
(You just)

137
00:06:49,510 --> 00:06:51,600
(want me to become a bald old tree.)

138
00:06:51,680 --> 00:06:53,480
Please, Uncle Maple.

139
00:06:54,240 --> 00:06:54,920
Uncle Maple?

140
00:06:57,040 --> 00:06:57,870
Uncle Maple.

141
00:06:59,190 --> 00:07:00,000
Uncle Maple.

142
00:07:00,680 --> 00:07:02,070
(Alright, fine. Stop scratching.)

143
00:07:02,160 --> 00:07:03,120
(I give up.)

144
00:07:03,360 --> 00:07:04,040
(Only one hour.)

145
00:07:04,090 --> 00:07:05,430
Thank you, Uncle Maple. Thank you.

146
00:07:19,680 --> 00:07:20,630
What are you doing?

147
00:07:23,360 --> 00:07:23,800
You...

148
00:07:23,950 --> 00:07:24,680
What are you trying to do?

149
00:07:34,560 --> 00:07:35,600
We've swapped back?

150
00:07:36,830 --> 00:07:38,360
Don't celebrate too soon.

151
00:07:38,950 --> 00:07:41,000
I borrowed a wisp of spirit essence
from a friend.

152
00:07:41,310 --> 00:07:42,920
It only lasts an hour each day.

153
00:07:45,240 --> 00:07:46,270
When this mark disappears,

154
00:07:46,390 --> 00:07:47,390
we'll swap back.

155
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:48,690
When the mark fades,

156
00:07:48,740 --> 00:07:49,950
remember to tell me in advance.

157
00:07:50,240 --> 00:07:51,270
Those geezers.

158
00:07:51,390 --> 00:07:52,430
Not a single one is reliable.

159
00:07:55,310 --> 00:07:56,160
This works too.

160
00:07:57,070 --> 00:07:57,680
Alright now.

161
00:07:57,830 --> 00:07:58,830
Time is tight. We have much to do.

162
00:07:59,120 --> 00:08:00,120
Hurry and get out.

163
00:08:00,240 --> 00:08:01,120
I need to bathe and change.

164
00:08:05,560 --> 00:08:06,120
Oh, right.

165
00:08:06,270 --> 00:08:07,240
I'm the one leaving.

166
00:08:14,660 --> 00:08:18,260
(38 Days Before the City Falls)

167
00:08:24,270 --> 00:08:25,430
Are you satisfied, Diviner Song?

168
00:08:30,720 --> 00:08:32,000
You make quite the handsome young man.

169
00:08:32,270 --> 00:08:34,150
Careful, or someone might
snatch you up as a husband.

170
00:08:45,860 --> 00:08:48,140
(Vessel Shop)

171
00:08:57,670 --> 00:08:58,390
Mr. Zhong.

172
00:09:05,360 --> 00:09:06,390
Mr. Zhong?

173
00:09:10,480 --> 00:09:11,750
Greetings, Diviner Song.

174
00:09:12,670 --> 00:09:14,600
I was so focused just now

175
00:09:14,870 --> 00:09:16,080
that I didn't see you come in.

176
00:09:16,440 --> 00:09:17,150
I beg

177
00:09:17,670 --> 00:09:18,960
your forgiveness, Diviner Song.

178
00:09:19,840 --> 00:09:20,550
It's fine.

179
00:09:22,200 --> 00:09:24,240
I trust your work more than anyone's,
Mr. Zhong.

180
00:09:24,510 --> 00:09:26,390
How is the work coming along?

181
00:09:28,910 --> 00:09:31,200
The deadline is really tight.

182
00:09:31,910 --> 00:09:32,630
I beg you

183
00:09:33,600 --> 00:09:35,720
to allow a few more days, Diviner Song.

184
00:09:36,200 --> 00:09:36,960
Mr. Zhong,

185
00:09:37,270 --> 00:09:38,630
the deadline isn't mine to set.

186
00:09:39,000 --> 00:09:40,360
If the King holds us responsible,

187
00:09:40,870 --> 00:09:42,150
neither of us can bear the consequences.

188
00:09:43,000 --> 00:09:44,000
Yes. Yes.

189
00:09:52,580 --> 00:09:58,250
♪Night rain falls in the courtyard,
shining on mortal partings♪

190
00:09:59,870 --> 00:10:05,330
♪Strangers meet again,
past lives gleam in endless hues♪

191
00:10:06,950 --> 00:10:10,180
♪A sharp arrow pierces memory♪

192
00:10:10,350 --> 00:10:13,660
♪Longing spreads like dye♪

193
00:10:13,790 --> 00:10:19,570
♪Beaded curtains
keep love and hate apart♪

194
00:10:21,030 --> 00:10:26,250
♪Through boundless grief,
love remains hard to sever♪

195
00:10:28,110 --> 00:10:34,300
♪A past bond, a parting dream;
when cold ends, purest joy remains♪

196
00:10:34,550 --> 00:10:38,060
♪That year,
pear blossoms, verse, and laughter♪

197
00:10:38,110 --> 00:10:41,390
♪One night, snow fell in wild flurries♪

198
00:10:41,440 --> 00:10:48,380
♪All perfection in this world
hides regret♪

199
00:10:48,630 --> 00:10:51,940
♪A drop of heart's blood seals love♪

200
00:10:52,270 --> 00:10:56,180
♪No more longing enters dreams♪

201
00:10:56,230 --> 00:11:02,540
♪When all turns to mist,
may you and I be safe forever♪

202
00:11:31,610 --> 00:11:38,390
♪Through boundless grief,
love remains hard to sever♪

203
00:11:38,440 --> 00:11:44,620
♪A past bond, a parting dream;
when cold ends, purest joy remains♪
